.TH tkcanvaspng n 0.2 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkcanvaspng \- render a Tk canvas to a PNG (pure Tcl)
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkcanvaspng
.br
set png [::tkutils::tkcanvaspng::render canvas ?options?]
.br
::tkutils::tkcanvaspng::write file canvas ?options?
.SH DESCRIPTION
Renders a Tk canvas to PNG bytes using the pure-Tcl tupngdraw engine (no external
tools). Options: -region, -scale, -background, -textcmd, -fontmap (TTF text needs
the optional Glyphs package). Requires tclutils::tupngdraw. See docs/tkcanvaspng.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, canvas, PNG, export
